# ── Grading truth must never enter this repository (M2 P2.7h-33) ──────────
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Hidden-test inputs, their expected outputs and
# reference solutions are the answer key for questions that are served to
# learners and graded. The database is the source of truth for all of it;
# nothing here needs a copy.
#
# Phase 19 committed the pilot suite plans, and the checkpoint before it
# carried suite expansions and a reference solution for two questions that
# are PUBLISHED and adaptive-eligible. Both were untracked in Phase 20.5.
#
# Statements, starter boilerplate and quality specs (which hold MUTANTS —
# wrong solutions — not answers) are deliberately NOT ignored: those are
# public by design.
artifacts/**/references-*/
artifacts/**/suites-*/
backend/LearnLM/remediation/*_suite_expansion.json
backend/LearnLM/remediation/*_approved_cases.json
backend/LearnLM/remediation/*_case*_input.json
backend/LearnLM/remediation/*_reference_*.py
pilot_*/reference_*.py
